  "notes": [
    "domain verifier-verified 2026-09-28 (official + Mobile + 48pedia + fandom + Wikipedia; no ASR).",
    "No documented opening コント — do not invent a sketch slot like Saka Agari.",
    "MC1／自己紹介 = photo + member intros + catchcopies after Omatase Set list.",
    "Unit block B sizes: Cross 3, Finland Miracle 3, Manazashi Sayonara 2, Usotsuki na Dachou 3, Nice to meet you! 5.",
    "Do not hardcode unit casts; birthday/understudy/12-member formats shuffle.",
    "Encore call sits AFTER Akushu no Ai and BEFORE Bowling Ganbou.",
    "MC4 sits after 16iro no Yume Crayon, before Ramune no Nomikata (title finale).",
    "Birthday shows typically EXPAND MC4 (host + birthday song + photo + letter + speech) then M16 — song order unchanged.",
    "Skip translating: encore_call, end_greetings. Still detect so they are not merged into MC/outro.",
    "Official orthography: ウイニングボール (ウ not ウィ); Nice to meet you ! (space before ! OK).",
    "Schedule lock often: HKT48 7期研究生「ラムネの飲み方」公演; setlist page omits 7期.",
    "Talk dur_s are PROVISIONAL soft hints (no Ramune grade_anchor_show yet); prefer finder labels over durations.",
    "Low-confidence: unit understudies, birthday unit shuffle, day roles (仔犬/プリマ/バッター), 12 vs 16 cast."
  ],
